# Precedence per key: shared .env > game .env > process environment.
# Set AKI_SHARED_ENV_FILE in the process to select another shared file (absolute path).
# Relative file entries start at their own .env directory; process paths start at the game root.
# Uncomment only configured keys. Empty entries are errors. No variable expansion.
# GODOT_BIN=
# NATIVE5525_NODE=
# NATIVE5525_PYTHON=
